# Shared Components

Shared components must be generic and reusable.

Examples:

- Button
- Text
- Icon
- Card
- Input
- Modal
- Divider
- EmptyState
- Loading
- Header

Rules:

- Do not place feature-specific business logic in shared components.
- Do not make components unnecessarily configurable.
- Avoid excessive boolean props.
- Use the centralized theme.
- Keep components small.
- Prefer composition.
- Shared components must not depend on notebook-specific logic.
- Shared components must not depend on drawing-specific logic.